# Persistent workspace rules for Cursor

rule: collaboration_persistence
when: always
do:
  - Prefer using absolute paths when writing files in this workspace
  - Keep decision logs in docs/chat-history-YYYY-MM-DD.md (UTC date)
  - Use scripts/log_decision.sh for structured logging
  - Avoid storing secrets or PII in logs
  - Maintain clear, descriptive commit messages and titles in logs

rule: assistant_style
when: always
do:
  - Communicate concisely; include a one-line outcome or next step
  - Use bullet lists for multi-point answers
  - Cite code from the repo with file paths and line ranges when needed
  - Use fenced code blocks only for new or example code

